# Sonar-Scan.bat carries credentials; Stop-Sonar.bat is paired with it.
scripts/Sonar-Scan.bat
scripts/Stop-Sonar.bat
# run_ci_checks.bat was ignored alongside those two but holds no credentials -
# it only redirects `cargo clippy` output into sonar-issues.json. Keeping it
# out of the repo meant the local gate and .github/workflows/ci.yml were two
# unsynchronised definitions of "the checks", and they had silently diverged
# on bandit severity. Tracked now so the two can be diffed.

